n7le06ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "51000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What I need is a vacation. If I went away tomorrow, I would lie on the beach for a week.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Your body can only put up with so much stress. Sooner or later, it's going to break down. You wouldn't want that to happen.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No, I wouldn't. So, I'd better turn in for the night. Sorry, Sally, I'm going to let you go. We'll talk soon.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Alright. Take care, OK?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I will. Thanks. Bye.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le06ob10re2img02.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le06ob10re2img01.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}